ts=2026-04-18T03:13:47.258Z type=context scope=codebase:tempest-tradingview-mcp content="origin/main already contains the merged price-pattern engine from ENG-32 in src/tempest_mcp/indicators/structure.py, including detect_swing_points, classify_market_structure, detect_price_ranges, and detect_range_breakouts, with tests in tests/test_indicators/test_structure_price_patterns.py. Backlog tickets that still target a separate market_structure.py implementation are likely stale/superseded and should be rewritten as higher-level composition/API work instead of re-implementing indicator internals." issue=ENG-33 tags=backlog-review,indicators,market-structure,superseded-work
ts=2026-04-18T03:17:51.937Z type=context scope=codebase:tempest-tradingview-mcp content="As of origin/main at merge commit 7204674 (ENG-32), the repo already includes indicator-layer price-pattern primitives in src/tempest_mcp/indicators/structure.py: detect_swing_points, classify_market_structure, detect_price_ranges, detect_range_breakouts; existing ADX support lives in src/tempest_mcp/indicators/momentum/macd_adx_stoch.py; no market-structure summary entrypoint or tool/server exposure for these primitives exists yet." issue=ENG-33 tags=indicators,structure,adx,origin-main,scope-review
ts=2026-04-18T03:37:48.544Z type=decision scope=shuna:ENG-33 content="Pinned ENG-33 as indicator-layer composition only in src/tempest_mcp/indicators/structure.py using existing detect_swing_points/classify_market_structure/detect_price_ranges/detect_range_breakouts plus calculate_adx; no server/tool-layer wiring and no new nested indicators/structure/market_structure.py path." issue=ENG-33 tags=design,indicator-layer,composition,boundaries
ts=2026-04-18T03:37:48.569Z type=context scope=codebase:tempest-tradingview-mcp content="Market-structure summary contract for ENG-33 is a deterministic single-row DataFrame with 22 pinned columns and priority decision ladder: insufficient_data -> breakout_up/down -> ranging -> trending_up/down -> transition, with explicit ADX/DI/range/breakout thresholds." issue=ENG-33 tags=api-contract,schema,decision-rules,deterministic-output
